[node name="LooksStop" type="Node3D" unique_id=252518224]
editor_description = "assets/21: the Elevator stop's Looks (elevator.md, How it is authored), the old hatch on the port's shaft. Origin: the stop's floor, in the hatch's face plane, across the opening's middle; the face looks +Z, the shaft is behind (-Z); the call button's column on the viewer's right. Hatch is the panel's AnimatableBody3D, keyed itself by open and shut (0.5 s, hatch_time: played at the speed that fits it); its RemoteTransform3D draws the model's panel there; the padlock sign and the OUT OF ORDER plaque hang on it. Model/call_<l> is one floor's stud, call button, chain and padlock: call_b shows here, the stop shows its floor's. Clips: out_of_order and repaired (the plaque, TagPlayer), locked and unlock (the padlock sign and the column's chain and padlock, LockPlayer; the old LockSign and Padlock pops, pop_time 0.6), press (the button, ButtonPlayer)."

